(s) "party" means a party to a mediation agreement or mediation proceeding whose agreement or
consent is necessary to resolve the dispute and includes their successors;
(t) "place of business" includes—
(a) a place from where the business is ordinarily carried on, and includes a warehouse, a godown
or any other place where a party stores it's goods, supplies or receives goods or services or both; or
